The numbers is a list of 1, 2, 3, and 1.
The indexgap is 3.
The valuegap is 0.
The last is the last position of numbers.
The found is 0.
For every left from 0 to last.
For every right from left plus 1 to last.
The gap is right minus left.
The difference is item left of numbers minus item right of numbers.
If difference is less than 0, set difference to 0 minus difference.
If gap is at most indexgap and difference is at most valuegap, set found to 1.

If found is 1, show true, otherwise show false.
